def $flatten_typeParameterList(typeParameterList')

1. Case analysis on typeParameterList'

  1. Case (let typeParameter be %, % has type typeParameter)

    1. Return [typeParameter]

  2. Case (let (typeParameterList ',' typeParameter) be %, % matches pattern `% , %`)

