def $callableId'(parameterList)

1. Block (2 arms)

Arm 1:

  1. Case analysis on parameterList

    1. Case (% matches pattern `/* empty */`)

      1. Return []

    2. Case (let (_annotationList _direction _type name _initializerOpt) be %, % has type parameter)

