    1. (Let (nonEmptyParameterList ',' (_annotationList _direction _type name _initializerOpt)) be nonEmptyParameterList', nonEmptyParameterList' matches pattern `% , %`)

      1. (Let (id)*{id <- id*} be $callableId'((nonEmptyParameterList as parameterList)))

