def $un_op(unop, value)

1. Case analysis on unop

  1. Case (% matches pattern `~`)

    1. Return $un_bnot(value)

  2. Case (% matches pattern `!`)

    1. Return $un_lnot(value)

  3. Case (% matches pattern `+`)

    1. Return $un_plus(value)

  4. Case (% matches pattern `-`)

    1. Return $un_minus(value)

def $un_bnot(value)

1. (Let integerLiteral be value, value has type integerLiteral)

  1. Case analysis on integerLiteral

    1. Case (let (w W i) be %, % matches pattern `% W %`)

      1. (Let i' be $bneg(i))

      2. (Let int be $pow2(w))

      3. (Let i'' be $ite<int>((i' >= (0 as int)), i', (int + i')))

      4. Return ((w W i'') as value)

    2. Case (let (w S i) be %, % matches pattern `% S %`)

      1. (Let i' be $bneg(i))

      2. (Let int' be $pow2(w))

      3. (Let i'' be $ite<int>((i' >= (0 as int)), i', (int' + i')))

      4. Return ((w S i'') as value)

  1. Else Dangling#1537

