def $lift_baseTypeIR(baseTypeIR)

1. Case analysis on baseTypeIR

  1. Case (let boolTypeIR be %, % has type boolTypeIR)

    1. Return (BOOL)

  2. Case (let errorTypeIR be %, % has type errorTypeIR)

    1. Block (2 arms)

    Arm 1:

      1. Return (ERROR)

    Arm 2:

      1. Return (ERROR)

  3. Case (let matchKindTypeIR be %, % has type matchKindTypeIR)

    1. Return (MATCH_KIND)

  4. Case (let stringTypeIR be %, % has type stringTypeIR)

    1. Return (STRING)

  5. Case (let intTypeIR be %, % has type intTypeIR)

    1. Return (INT)

  6. Case (let (INT `< w `>) be %, % has type fixedIntTypeIR)

    1. Return (INT `< (w as int) `>)

  7. Case (let (BIT `< w `>) be %, % has type fixedBitTypeIR)

    1. Return (BIT `< (w as int) `>)

  8. Case (let (VARBIT `< w `>) be %, % has type varBitTypeIR)

    1. Return (VARBIT `< (w as int) `>)

1. Else Dangling#3148

