def $find_var_t(prefixedNameIR, p, TC)

1. Case analysis on prefixedNameIR

  1. Case (let ('.' id) be %, % matches pattern `. %`)

    1. (Let typeFrame be TC.GLOBAL.FRAME)

    2. Return $find_map<id, varTypeIR>(typeFrame, id)

  2. Case (let (_BARE id) be %, % matches pattern `_BARE %`)

    1. Case analysis on p

      1. Case (% matches pattern `GLOBAL`)

        1. (Let typeFrame be TC.GLOBAL.FRAME)

        2. Return $find_map<id, varTypeIR>(typeFrame, id)

      2. Case (% matches pattern `BLOCK`)

        1. (Let typeFrame be TC.BLOCK.FRAME)

        2. Block (2 arms)

        Arm 1:

          1. (Let varTypeIR be ! $find_map<id, varTypeIR>(typeFrame, id))

            1. Return ?(varTypeIR)

        Arm 2:

          1. If (($find_map<id, varTypeIR>(typeFrame, id) matches pattern ())), then

            1. Return $find_var_t((_BARE id), (GLOBAL), TC)

          1. Else Dangling#4399

      3. Case (% matches pattern `LOCAL`)

        1. (Let (typeFrame)*{typeFrame <- typeFrame*} be TC.LOCAL.FRAMES)

        2. Block (2 arms)

        Arm 1:

          1. (Let varTypeIR be ! $find_maps<id, varTypeIR>((typeFrame)*{typeFrame <- typeFrame*}, id))

            1. Return ?(varTypeIR)

        Arm 2:

