          2. Result in: % % |- % : ((prefixedNameIR as expressionIR) '#' expressionNoteIR)

    Arm 2:

      1. If ((expression'' = ((THIS) as expression))), then

        1. (Let prefixedNameIR be (_BARE "this"))

