              2. (Let typeIR be $type_of_typedExpressionIR(typedExpressionIR))

              3. If (($ctk_of_typedExpressionIR(typedExpressionIR) matches pattern `LCTK`)), then

                1. (Let typeIR_unroll be $unroll_typeIR(typeIR))

                2. If (((typeIR_unroll has type integerTypeIR) /\ ~(typeIR_unroll has type varBitTypeIR))), then

                  1. (Expr_eval_lctk: (LOCAL) TC |- typedExpressionIR ~> value)

                  2. (Let integerValue be value, value has type integerValue)

                    1. (Let n_delta be ! $nat_of_integerValue(integerValue))

                      1. If ((n_delta > 0)), then

                        1. (Let TBLC_1 be TBLC_0[PRIORITIES.DELTA = n_delta])

                        2. (Let constOptIR be $flatten_constOpt(constOpt))

                        3. (Let tablePropertyIR be ((annotationList constOptIR CUSTOM_CONST "priority_delta" ('=' _VALUE ((D (n_delta as int)) as value)) ';') as tablePropertyIR))

                        4. Result in: % % |- % : TBLC_1 tablePropertyIR

                      1. Else Dangling#7847

                2. Else Dangling#7840

              3. Else Dangling#7838

            1. Else Dangling#7835

      Arm 2:

        1. Group size-and-others: TC TBLC_0 |- (annotationList constOpt tableCustomName ('=' expression) ';') : % %

          1. Block (2 arms)

          Arm 1:

            1. If (("size" = $tableCustomName(tableCustomName))), then

