            2. Result in: % % |- % : (simpleKeysetExpressionIR as keysetExpressionIR)

          1. Else Dangling#9531

      1. Else Dangling#9527

Arm 2:

  1. (Let tupleKeysetExpression be keysetExpression, keysetExpression has type tupleKeysetExpression)

