relation TableAction_inst: IC STO |- (annotationList tableActionReferenceIR '#' `( parameterListIR ',' parameterListIR_control `) ';') : % %

1. Group : IC STO |- (annotationList tableActionReferenceIR '#' `( parameterListIR ',' parameterListIR_control `) ';') : % %

  1. (Let (prefixedNameIR _controlPlaneNameIR `( argumentListIR `)) be tableActionReferenceIR)

  2. (Let (cursor, _callableId, callableDef) be ! $find_callableDef_non_overload_i((LOCAL), IC, prefixedNameIR))

    1. (Let actionDef be callableDef, callableDef has type actionDef)

      1. (Let (annotationList_actionDef ACTION nameIR `( _parameterListIR `) _blockStatementIR) be actionDef)

      2. Block (2 arms)

      Arm 1:

        1. (Let (nameIR')*{nameIR' <- nameIR'*} be $name_annotation(annotationList_actionDef))

        2. (Let [nameIR_anno] be (nameIR')*{nameIR' <- nameIR'*}, (nameIR')*{nameIR' <- nameIR'*} matches pattern [ _/1 ])

          1. Case analysis on $starts_with(nameIR_anno, ".")

            1. Case true

              1. (Let text be $strip_prefix(nameIR_anno, "."))

              2. (Let controlPlaneNameIR be ?(text))

              3. (Let tableActionReferenceIR' be (prefixedNameIR controlPlaneNameIR `( argumentListIR `)))

              4. (Let tableActionIR be (annotationList tableActionReferenceIR' '#' `( parameterListIR ',' parameterListIR_control `) ';'))

              5. Result in: % % |- % : STO tableActionIR

            2. Case false

              1. (Let text' be $join_text(IC.PATH ++ [nameIR_anno], "."))

              2. (Let controlPlaneNameIR be $ite<controlPlaneNameIR>((cursor = (GLOBAL)), ?(nameIR_anno), ?(text')))

              3. (Let tableActionReferenceIR' be (prefixedNameIR controlPlaneNameIR `( argumentListIR `)))

              4. (Let tableActionIR be (annotationList tableActionReferenceIR' '#' `( parameterListIR ',' parameterListIR_control `) ';'))

              5. Result in: % % |- % : STO tableActionIR

      Arm 2:

        1. If (($name_annotation(annotationList_actionDef) matches pattern [])), then

          1. (Let text'' be $join_text(IC.PATH ++ [nameIR], "."))

          2. (Let controlPlaneNameIR be $ite<controlPlaneNameIR>((cursor = (GLOBAL)), ?(nameIR), ?(text'')))

          3. (Let tableActionReferenceIR' be (prefixedNameIR controlPlaneNameIR `( argumentListIR `)))

          4. (Let tableActionIR be (annotationList tableActionReferenceIR' '#' `( parameterListIR ',' parameterListIR_control `) ';'))

          5. Result in: % % |- % : STO tableActionIR

        1. Else Dangling#10739

