    4. Case (let (typedExpressionIR_l binop typedExpressionIR_r) be %, % has type binaryExpressionIR)

      1. Group binaryExpressionIR: p EC ARCH |- (((typedExpressionIR_l binop typedExpressionIR_r) as expressionIR) '#' expressionNoteIR) : % % %

        1. Block (2 arms)

        Arm 1:

          1. If (~binop is in [('&&'), ('||')]), then

            1. (Exprs_eval: p EC ARCH |- [typedExpressionIR_l, typedExpressionIR_r] : EC_1 ARCH_1 expressionListResult)

