          1. Group memberAccessExpressionIR-type: p EC ARCH |- ((((TYPE prefixedNameIR) '.' nameIR) as expressionIR) '#' expressionNoteIR) : % % %

            1. (Let typeDefIR be ! $find_typeDef_e(p, EC, prefixedNameIR))

