    14. Case (let callExpressionIR be %, % has type callExpressionIR)

      1. (Let (callableTargetIR `< (typeArgumentIR)*{typeArgumentIR <- typeArgumentIR*} `> `( (argumentIR)*{argumentIR <- argumentIR*} `)) be callExpressionIR, callExpressionIR matches pattern `% <%> (%)`)

