    15. Case (let (`( typedExpressionIR `)) be %, % has type parenthesizedExpressionIR)

      1. Group parenthesizedExpressionIR: p EC ARCH |- (((`( typedExpressionIR `)) as expressionIR) '#' expressionNoteIR) : % % %

